{
  "name": "view-calls-tab-notify-keep",
  "description": "A view reports a progress notice with an action and a system flag, moves it to 50 percent, ends it as a success, and reports a busy keep. The host answers the notice with its id.",
  "replay": false,
  "reason": "The view calls reach the page as the notice view-call of a view that the host runs in a window, which the Go producer does not run (docs/spec/cases/page-wire/README.md#producer-runs).",
